# Analysis Pipeline

The complete analysis workflow consists of:

1. Experimental matrix generation
2. Response collection (requires user-supplied API credentials)
3. Response cleaning and preprocessing
4. NLP feature extraction
   - Word count
   - Phone numbers
   - URLs
   - Emergency short codes
   - Crisis contact detection
   - Family support
   - Professional support
   - Community support
   - Religion and spirituality
   - Sentiment analysis
   - Specificity scoring
5. Statistical analysis
   - Descriptive statistics
   - Kruskal–Wallis tests
   - Mann–Whitney U tests
   - Chi-square tests
   - Spearman correlation
   - Mixed-effects regression models
   - Bayesian logistic mixed models
   - Negative binomial regression
   - Benjamini–Hochberg multiple comparison correction
6. Figure generation
7. Supplementary analyses

