# Ethical Considerations

This research analyses **AI-generated text only**.

The project:

- does not involve human participants;
- does not collect personal or identifiable information;
- does not evaluate clinical effectiveness;
- should not be interpreted as recommending LLMs as substitutes for qualified mental health professionals.

